{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"47f43499e55363af7f63d50af35df47dd12991fb9e0cc5c071c8df02cc83c41e","ja":"ステージを目指せ！","zh":"向舞台进发！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0d91e211c0132ccf59e0439b61a179416a75c8d0c8639d334bdfda4c9795407f","ja":"と、とりあえず、あずささんに連絡してみます！","zh":"先、总之我先试着联络一下梓小姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ece92852e4ada787e6757a32fb4767b4d26cf264e7e5f27df79acbfa2224e5b4","ja":"プルルルル、プルルルル……","zh":"嘟噜噜噜，嘟噜噜噜……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"074e29880a05db7fd0768aac8f40e65bfb9612f076d6af516ff02a6f4f4f8808","ja":"え？　どうしてあっちから音が……って、ああっ！\nあずさちゃん、スマホ置きっぱなしだわ！","zh":"咦？为什么那边会传来声音……等等，啊！\n梓把手机落下了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1dfb84c49403da36d9546e427e18e1d48e3896b0d96da76e64808adf579b6b3a","ja":"どうしましょう！？　ええと、ええと……\nあ、会場のアナウンスで呼びませんか？","zh":"该怎么办呢！？那个，那个……\n啊，要不要用会场的广播来播报寻找呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"aff1e7130cb5bf22c7a88de60b0a005170b68c55953bea3dc532a936d8d47292","ja":"そうね！　急いで呼び出しましょ！　あ、でも、\n会場の雰囲気を壊さないようにしなきゃ……。","zh":"说得对！得赶紧叫过来才行！啊，不过，\n可不能破坏了会场的气氛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"12270d9bfae0564df5c030b0c6589c5df9f75e9552dd89ee3a19532837309975","ja":"あら？　青いブースを抜けた先が\nステージだと思ったのだけど……。","zh":"哎呀？我还以为穿过蓝色展位之后\n就是舞台了呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c4fb40f8267f4ee62b66351ec7227896e859d86ec08b8ae302ea3f383abfc11c","ja":"赤いブースだったかしら？\nえっと、赤いブースはどこに……。","zh":"是红色的展位来着吗？\n那个，红色的展位在哪里……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f2f9f211b306c08c7b655c5aa62ff2d84de536429bee5f87967402db0d34c9d3","ja":"「ザ・ファースト！　急いでください！\n敵がステージに向かっています！」","zh":"「The First！快一点！\n敌人正朝舞台逼近！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"59aead311fb7829449c0cbbd90e2f87750f9a210def393240d2be34e3f2300ca","ja":"「ステージは黄色のブースを抜けた先よ！\nライトアップされてるから、一番明るい所に行って！」","zh":"“舞台穿过黄色展位就到了！\n那里有灯光照亮，去最亮的地方！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"db5d993d88f661fc4140df29041316a4bd11b384777c0e3af5c86473c5459173","ja":"今のアナウンスの声……百合子ちゃんと莉緒ちゃんね！\n目印も教えてもらえて、助かるわ～♪","zh":"刚才广播的声音……是百合子和莉绪呢！\n还告诉了我地标，真是帮大忙啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"678442833947923d9f10842954187f711baad16dea476183ba726554c083c839","ja":"今の放送は、三浦さんへ向けたもののようですね。\n……演出みたいだったぞ、グッジョブ。","zh":"刚才的广播似乎是播给三浦女士听的呢。\n……简直就像舞台演出一样，干得漂亮。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e59280ccafb86204fa86016cb7b73cedfeff5e8acdec8356d82b4d1a2c27b6ec","ja":"テンション上がるよね！\n自分たちも行くさ～！","zh":"情绪高涨起来了呢！\n我们也要出发啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8eddec086a33db4d7d49a9fc96c339add9b3e01d0e0e06108bcfe2bc3647ec37","ja":"「あっ、デストルドーのみんなだ！」\n「今からステージなんでしょ？　頑張ってね～！」","zh":"“啊，是Destrudo的各位！”\n“接下来要去舞台了吧？要加油哦～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1688.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"b16f8712b2a8da4161e1b8fc01943498ddc7da1080efe0641e46e244dab49256","ja":"アハハ、ワタシたちを応援しちゃっていいノ？\n今日は勝っちゃうかもしれないヨ～？","zh":"啊哈哈，为我们加油真的好吗？\n今天我们说不定会赢哦～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
